<%
  const breadcrumbs = [
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "Scania Double Cab Hearse", href: "/scania-double-cab-hearse" }
  ];
%>

<%- include('partials/head', {
  title,
  metaTitle: 'Scania Double Cab Hearse Hire UK | Family Passenger Truck Hearse',
  metaDescription: 'Discover our black 2003 Scania Double Cab truck hearse. Seats up to 7 people, allowing family members to travel with their loved one on The Final Journey.',
  canonicalPath: '/scania-double-cab-hearse',
  breadcrumbs
}) %>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<%
  const s = settings || {};
  const phoneRaw = String(s.phone || "").trim();
  const phoneTel = phoneRaw.replace(/\s+/g, "");

  // Optional admin-controlled Scania image.
  // Add this setting later if you want the image controlled through admin.
  const scaniaFile = String(s.scania_double_cab_img || s.home_truck_scania_img || "").trim();
  const scaniaVer  = String(s.scania_double_cab_ver || s.home_truck_scania_ver || "").trim();
%>

<div class="wrap">
  <%- include('partials/breadcrumbs', { breadcrumbs }) %>

  <div class="card">
    <h1 style="color: var(--accent);">Scania Double Cab Hearse</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Our Scania Double Cab Hearse is a distinctive specialist funeral vehicle, offering families the opportunity
      to travel with their loved one on The Final Journey.
    </p>

    <div class="cta" style="margin:18px 0 8px;">
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">Enquire about this hearse</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/gallery">View gallery</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/case-studies">Case studies</a>
      <% if (phoneTel) { %>
        <a class="btn" href="tel:<%= phoneTel %>">Call <%= phoneRaw %></a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <% if (scaniaFile) { %>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <img
        src="/uploads/<%= scaniaFile %>?v=<%= scaniaVer %>"
        alt="Scania Double Cab truck hearse seating up to 7 people for a personal final journey"
        style="display:block; width:100%; max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; border-radius:16px;"
      >
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Technical specifications</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Model:</strong> Scania Double Cab Hearse</p>
      <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Year of manufacture:</strong> 2003</p>
      <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Colour:</strong> Black</p>
      <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Engine:</strong> 8970cc</p>
      <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Fuel:</strong> Diesel</p>
      <p><strong style="color: var(--accent);">Seating:</strong> Seats up to 7 people</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;">
        <strong style="color: var(--accent);">Purpose:</strong>
        A family-focused truck hearse allowing selected family members to travel with their loved one on The Final Journey.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">A family-focused Scania Double Cab hearse</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        The Scania Double Cab Hearse offers something especially personal within our specialist fleet. With seating
        for up to 7 people, it gives family members the opportunity to travel together with their loved one as part
        of the final journey.
      </p>
      <p>
        For some families, being close throughout the journey can be an important and comforting part of the tribute.
        The Scania combines the presence of a full-size truck hearse with the added practicality of passenger seating.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">A design inspired by our fleet</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        The design of the Scania pays tribute to our ERF EC12 and Renault Magnum hearses, carefully capturing and
        mirroring their unique characteristics while offering its own individual role within PNW Carriage Masters.
      </p>
      <p>
        It has been created to sit naturally alongside our existing truck hearses, giving families another meaningful
        choice when planning a personal and memorable final journey.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Who this hearse often suits</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        The Scania Double Cab Hearse can be especially fitting for families who want to travel together as part of
        the funeral journey. It may also suit someone with a strong connection to haulage, transport, logistics,
        engineering, trucks or road life.
      </p>
      <p>
        Its passenger capacity makes it different from a conventional hearse and allows the journey itself to become
        a more personal part of the day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Why families choose the Scania Double Cab</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        Families may choose the Scania because it offers a more intimate and personal experience. Rather than following
        separately, selected family members can travel in the vehicle itself, accompanying their loved one on The Final Journey.
      </p>
      <p>
        This can make the funeral feel more connected, especially when the journey has particular meaning to the family
        or to the person being remembered.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">What to expect on the day</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        Our Scania Double Cab Hearse is supplied to work alongside the funeral director and the wider funeral arrangements
        already in place. As with all of our specialist hearses, the aim is to provide a vehicle that complements the day
        professionally, respectfully and with the right presence.
      </p>
      <p>
        Passenger arrangements, timing, route, venue access and the overall tone of the service all need to be considered
        carefully. The Scania is provided as part of a dignified final journey, not simply as a display vehicle.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Working with funeral directors</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        Our specialist hearses are supplied exclusively for the funeral profession. We work with funeral directors to
        confirm availability, discuss the location and service details, and help ensure the chosen vehicle is suitable
        for the funeral plans.
      </p>
      <p>
        Where family members wish to travel in the Scania, we can discuss the practical arrangements with the funeral
        director so that the vehicle is used appropriately and respectfully on the day.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Available for funerals across the UK</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        Our Scania Double Cab Hearse is available for funeral hire across the UK mainland. We are based near Chester,
        close to North Wales and North West England, but can provide specialist truck hearse hire much further afield,
        depending on the date, the location and the vehicle required.
      </p>
      <p>
        For availability, coverage and guidance on whether the Scania Double Cab Hearse is the right fit for a funeral,
        please contact us directly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Related gallery and case studies</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        You can explore more images on our <a href="/gallery">gallery page</a> and view recent field updates on our
        <a href="/case-studies">case studies page</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        These pages help show how our specialist hearses are used in real funeral settings and how a truck hearse can
        become a meaningful part of a personal final journey.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Frequently asked questions about this hearse</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p><strong>How many people can the Scania Double Cab Hearse seat?</strong><br>
        The Scania Double Cab Hearse seats up to 7 people, allowing selected family members to travel with their loved one.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Is the Scania Double Cab Hearse available across the UK?</strong><br>
        Yes. Availability depends on the date, the location and the overall funeral arrangements, so early enquiry is always helpful.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Who usually books this hearse?</strong><br>
        The vehicle is supplied for the funeral profession and is typically arranged as part of the funeral director’s plans for the service.
      </p>
      <p><strong>Why would a family choose this hearse?</strong><br>
        It is often chosen when family members want the opportunity to travel with their loved one, making the final journey feel especially personal.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;"><strong>Where can I find out more?</strong><br>
        You can also visit our <a href="/faq">FAQ page</a> or contact us directly to discuss availability and suitability.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title">Related pages</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p><a href="/renault-magnum-hearse">Renault Magnum hearse</a></p>
      <p><a href="/erf-ec12-hearse">ERF EC12 hearse</a></p>
      <p><a href="/lorry-hearse-hire-uk">Lorry hearse hire across the UK</a></p>
      <p><a href="/truck-hearse-vs-traditional-hearse">Truck hearse vs traditional hearse</a></p>
      <p><a href="/case-studies">Truck hearse case studies</a></p>
      <p><a href="/gallery">Gallery</a></p>
      <p><a href="/faq">FAQ</a></p>
      <p><a href="/contact">Contact</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--accent);">Enquire about the Scania Double Cab Hearse</h2>
    <div class="rich">
      <p>
        If you would like to discuss availability, location, passenger arrangements or whether the Scania Double Cab Hearse
        is the right fit for an upcoming funeral, please contact us directly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cta" style="margin:18px 0 0;">
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/gallery">View gallery</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/case-studies">View case studies</a>
      <% if (phoneTel) { %>
        <a class="btn" href="tel:<%= phoneTel %>">Call <%= phoneRaw %></a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
